1
00:00:00,412 --> 00:00:03,782
(Penny:)Oh, my God,
Sheldon the genius is jealous of Leonard.

2
00:00:03,948 --> 00:00:05,778
(Sheldon:)I'm not jealous.

3
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:10,980
(Sheldon:)I'm just very unhappy that good things are
happening for him and not happening for me.

4
00:00:11,656 --> 00:00:13,686
(Penny:)Sweetie, this is a natural thing to feel.

5
00:00:13,858 --> 00:00:16,328
(Penny:)Just because good things
are happening to Leonard...

6
00:00:16,494 --> 00:00:19,394
(Penny:)...doesn't take anything away from you.
Let me tell you a story.

7
00:00:19,564 --> 00:00:21,494
(Penny:)There was a girl who worked
at the Cheesecake Factory...

8
00:00:21,666 --> 00:00:23,466
...and she wasn't good at herjob.
- It was you.

9
00:00:23,635 --> 00:00:25,225
(Penny:)It wasn't me.

10
00:00:26,738 --> 00:00:28,068
(Penny:)But she was also an actress.

11
00:00:28,239 --> 00:00:31,569
(Penny:)We were both up for the same part
in a toothpaste commercial. She got it.

12
00:00:31,743 --> 00:00:35,403
(Penny:)I was so jealous, but instead of
ripping out her fake blond hair...

13
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,950
You ripped out your own fake blond hair.

14
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:43,240
(Penny:)I looked her in the eye, smiled and said,
"I'm happy for you."

15
00:00:43,455 --> 00:00:45,585
(Penny:)Because that's what friends do.

16
00:00:46,391 --> 00:00:48,421
(Sheldon:)They lie so they don't look petty.

17
00:00:48,593 --> 00:00:50,923
(Penny:)- Yeah.
- How?

18
00:00:51,096 --> 00:00:52,756
(Penny:)Like this.

19
00:00:52,964 --> 00:00:55,524
(Penny:)I am so happy for you.

20
00:00:58,636 --> 00:01:00,036
(Leonard:)Wow.

